WEBVTT

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:09.440
Please.

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:11.740
Hear my wish...

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:16.600
Kizunairo kokoro to kokoro

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:16.600
The color of bonds binding hearts to hearts

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.810
Yakusoku no basho kitto michibiku wa

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.810
Will surely lead us to the Promised Land.

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:24.070
Tsutaetai tsutaekirenai

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:24.070
I want to tell you, but I can't.

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:28.070
Hatenai omoi ha anata...

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:28.070
I always long for you...

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:38.500
Boukansha no hibi ni yuuki wo dashitara sayonara

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:38.500
Say goodbye to the days of just being a bystander.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:47.550
Demo "jiyuu" no teigi ni buranko no you ni yureteru no ne?

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:47.550
But am I swaying over the meaning of "Freedom", like a swing?

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:52.680
Gosenfu ni kaita kaidan

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:52.680
Stairs drawn on a music score,

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:56.180
Ippo susunde niho sagattemo

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:56.180
Even if I go down one step and back two steps,

00:00:56.180 --> 00:01:00.190
Honno chotto setsunasa utau

00:00:56.180 --> 00:01:00.190
The notes play a sad melody.

00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:03.230
Watashi no real kanjite ne

00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:03.230
Hear my reality!

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:07.150
Kizunairo kokoro to kokoro

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:07.150
The color of bonds binding hearts to hearts

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:10.700
Yakusoku no basho kitto michibikuwa

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:10.700
Will surely lead us to the Promised Land.

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:14.660
Tsutaetai tsutaekirenai

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:14.660
I want to tell you, but can't

00:01:14.660 --> 00:01:18.080
Zutto anata wo sagashiteta

00:01:14.660 --> 00:01:18.080
I've always been searching for you.

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:22.170
Tatoeba sou anataga hikari

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:22.170
Let's say you are the light

00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:25.630
Watashi ga kagede mitsume aetanara

00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:25.630
And I'm the shadow, gazing at one other.

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:29.670
Namida iro no diamond

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:29.670
The tear-colored diamond

00:01:29.670 --> 00:01:33.470
Nee zero kara kagayakasetai

00:01:29.670 --> 00:01:33.470
I want to make it shine from nothing.

00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:39.020
Kowagaranaide musunde ne ai wo

00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:39.020
Don't be afraid of falling in love.

00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:41.190
Deaiwo...

00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:41.190
Nor of meeting people...

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:47.620
Letter

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:44.910
Are you hungry at all?

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:46.540
Yeah, want to stop by somewhere?

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:50.460
Don't forget to
take one of these.

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:50.460
Hey, Haruna.

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:52.170
What are you up to?

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:53.460
For a
limited time

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:53.460
The Iron Chef's

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:53.460
Special Miso Ramen

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:53.460
Hi, Kouhei-kun.

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:54.920
Here, see?

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:57.220
For a
limited time

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:57.220
Community Service Month

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:57.220
Sparkle

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:57.220
Today's Theme:
Sort Your Rubbish!

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:01.100
The Student Council will be fully supporting it this year, right?

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:03.140
We are?

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:08.190
Okay! All preparations are made!

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:09.900
All that's left is to take action!

00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:12.610
So we're really doing this?

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:16.240
Why didn't he tell me about it?

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:18.610
Either way, I'll help out.

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:20.910
No, it's all right.

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:23.370
The entire Student Council's helping, right?

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:25.160
Then I can't just sit and watch.

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:28.660
Thank you.

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:35.760
Were you planning to put all of those up yourself?

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:37.380
Where are the other reps?

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:42.180
Note: Janken is Japanese for "Rock-Paper-Scissors"

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:40.470
I'm weak when it comes to janken.

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:42.180
Janken?

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:45.470
Oh yeah, you were always pretty bad at it, weren't you?

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:47.980
S-Sorry.

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:50.270
Why are you apologizing?

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:52.650
R-Right...

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:54.070
Sorry.

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:56.230
You apologized again.

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:58.490
Ah...

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:01.530
Hey, are you feeling hungry at all?

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:03.910
The Iron Chef's

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:03.910
Special Miso Ramen

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:03.910
The Cafeteria's
Iron Chef

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:07.370
Let's wrap this up and go eat
the Iron Chef's special miso ramen.

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:09.750
The Iron Chef's

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:09.750
Special Miso Ramen

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:08.250
Yup.

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:09.750
Okay, then let's get moving.

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:11.830
I'll carry it.

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:14.540
Don't worry. Let's finish posting these.

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.800
By the way, Kouhei-kun.

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:19.670
The other day...

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:30.560
Suzuki Maya

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:24.720
Nice. Nice. It's certain that Hina-chan loves Kouhei.

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:29.810
But, what does Kouhei think of Hina-chan?

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:42.110
I wonder if Kouhei-kun's still troubled by it, too.

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:45.030
All the memories are packed in here, yet...

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:46.530
Hasekura Kouhei

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:52.160
It was six years ago.

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:55.630
Kou-chan, is this really good-bye?

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:59.800
It's Dad's work, so I can't do anything about it.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:02.430
So, good-bye.

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:05.550
No. It's not a good-bye.

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:11.270
Even if we live far apart, we're still friends.

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:12.890
I'll write letters to you.

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:15.900
You'll always be my friend.

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:22.490
I shouldn't look forward to it.

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:26.120
Migratory birds don't make friends.

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:32.580
But Haruna did send me letters.

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:36.170
Just like she promised, she sent many of them.

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:38.500
Yuuki

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:38.500
Hasekura Kouhei-sama

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:37.380
One after another.

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.510
He's reading them.

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:49.680
Those are the letters Hina-chan sent to him long ago, right?

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:52.600
So that means Kouhei...

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:57.560
Yuuki Haruna

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:12.660
Dear Kouhei-kun

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:12.660
I'm sorry...

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:19.420
Could that be?

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:23.210
That was close.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:25.300
Kouhei didn't notice me, right?

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:26.220
Hey!

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:30.800
Kanade-san! What are you doing?

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:37.690
Onee-chan!

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:41.020
Your guardian's here to pick you up.

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:46.150
She went to Kouhei-kun's room alone at this hour?

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:51.080
The RA trespassing won't fly as a joke at all.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:53.330
So take her away, will you?

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.790
I wasn't trespassing.

00:05:55.790 --> 00:06:00.670
I was only wondering what Kouhei usually does...

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:02.250
Onee-chan?

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:06.300
Oh no! It's time for me to water the cactus!

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:09.090
And so, bye-bye!

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:12.010
Could Onee-chan...

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:16.850
Looks like you have your work cut out for you.

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:19.310
No, not at all.

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:24.190
I'm sorry Onee-chan disturbed you.

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:25.940
No, it's nothing.

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.320
I'll get going, too.

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:28.900
See you tomorrow.

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:31.990
What was that?

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:36.790
So, have you repented for what you did last night?

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:37.830
I did.

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:40.120
As an apology, I'll give you a shitake mushroom.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:40.750
There.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:43.500
Right. Only because you don't like them.

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.500
It's really good.

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:49.090
Hina-chan! Over here!

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:54.260
It's fine. I'll eat over there.

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:57.520
What are you saying? Come on.

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:01.150
Hey, Onee-chan...

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:03.690
No worries, no worries.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:06.280
Take a seat, Hina-chan.

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:12.660
Don't worry. Leave it to me.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:16.330
I'll do anything if it's for you.

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:20.870
Gosh, I'm already full.

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:24.170
The third wheel will disappear and leave the area to the kids.

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:26.750
What is she up to?

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:31.630
Huh? Why did it end up like this?

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:33.680
Haruna?

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:41.810
The tea Hina-chan makes is the best.

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:44.060
Come on now, Kouhei's cup's empty.

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:46.320
Oh, sorry I didn't notice.

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:48.030
No, it's all right.

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:50.110
Can I also get-

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:54.620
Be more sensitive.

00:07:55.700 --> 00:08:00.870
I bet my kind bride will one day eventually become a real bride.

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:04.920
I'm so jealous of that man.

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:06.290
Kouhei-kun.

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:08.210
K-Kanade-san?

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:10.670
What are you saying, Onee-chan?

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:12.170
The two of them are getting married?

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:16.800
Heiji, who asked such an insensitive question, will get disciplinary stickers!

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:19.310
Why do I deserve this?

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:26.020
You don't have to get involved.

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:27.480
Gosh, Onee-chan...

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:33.200
Don't you think Kanade-san's been strange these last few days?

00:08:34.150 --> 00:08:36.740
Y-Yeah. I agree.

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:39.080
Does anything stand out to you?

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:43.000
I'll do anything if it's for you.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:45.710
She can't be trying to... can she?

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:47.250
Gather up!

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:53.010
The big event the Student Council is hosting during this Keep Things Tidy Month is starting!

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:56.970
Oh no! I need to get down there!

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:58.010
What's starting?

00:08:58.010 --> 00:09:00.930
Today, we're publicizing the new uniform for those who are part of the Cleaning Committee!

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:02.470
Publicizing the uniform?

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:05.560
Hold on! I'm coming with you!

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:10.360
The special event you've all been waiting for is starting!

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:13.440
First, Tougi Shiro-chan!

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:21.200
Next up, the Vice-President, Sendou Erika!

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:33.130
Why am I up here, too?

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:36.180
I knew I was right.

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:39.260
This idea of mine that I got from the Sports Festival.

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:44.310
The trump card to make everyone realize it's Keep Things Tidy Month.

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:47.980
It's the ultimate weapon!

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:50.940
W-Wow...

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:55.400
I see. If I'd known about this,
I would have fully objected to it.

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:00.070
I'm sorry for coming late.

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:04.910
Haruna...

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:08.170
There goes my bride.

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:10.960
Are you happy, you lucky dog?

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:13.340
Ow... You're saying things like that again.

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:15.590
Let's go. I'll take a picture with her.

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:19.430
Ex-squeeze us!

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:21.140
Come, come, come.

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:22.720
Hey there. No pushing.

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:24.770
Don't be so stingy.

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:26.390
If you will, Sei-chan.

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:30.650
Ready?

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:31.650
Kanade-san...

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:33.730
Gosh, Onee-chan...

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:37.110
Huh? But Hina-chan, don't you...

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:41.820
I only want my loving Hina-chan to be happy.

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:44.160
I'd do anything for you.

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:49.670
Why? Why do you say things like that?

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:52.170
Hina-chan?

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:59.050
Why do you neglect yourself and only worry for me?

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:00.720
Haruna?

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:04.300
Why?

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:05.850
That's because...

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:08.390
Because...

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:12.730
Because I got in an accident and lost all my memories?!

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:21.070
That doesn't make me happy at all.

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:22.490
I don't like it when you do this!

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:24.200
Hina-chan!

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:24.830
Haruna!

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:50.390
Why the big sigh?

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:52.730
Oh, Kouhei.

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:55.730
No, it's nothing.

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:58.280
Your face doesn't say that.

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:00.530
Is it about Haruna?

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:02.910
It's...

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:10.790
Sorry. I totally thought what was between you and Hina-chan was mutual.

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:13.420
It's not like that between Haruna and me.

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:14.830
Both in the past and now.

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:17.540
So even in the past, too...

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:19.920
Kouhei-kun.

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:20.840
Haruna.

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:27.220
Hina-chan.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:35.810
So you haven't made up yet.

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:38.610
It's my fault.

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:41.230
It's because I did something uncalled for.

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:42.570
What should I do?

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:49.700
Hina-chan used to be very weak when she was little and kept going back and forth between the hospital and home.

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:54.000
She had things like bone marrow transplants done, too.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.710
That's when Mom told me,

00:12:56.710 --> 00:13:02.590
"You're the big sister, Kanade, so make sure you look out for Hina-chan."

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:04.300
I see.

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:08.220
And yet, that day...

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:09.720
Hina-chan!

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:14.940
Onee-chan.

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:17.150
Oh, I'm relieved.

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:20.360
You're my big sister, right?

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:23.740
Where am I?

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:26.070
What was I doing?

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:28.490
Why am I here?

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:30.740
Hina-chan.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:34.500
It's my fault.

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:37.870
Because of my carelessness, Hina-chan had to...

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:39.750
It was an accident, right?

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:41.800
It's not your fault.

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:45.840
But because of that,

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:49.260
Hina-chan lost a year of memories; the year she spent with you!

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:54.930
The letters you two had been sending to each other came to an end, too.

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:57.560
I'm sorry. I'm sorry, Kouhei.

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:01.980
She can't do anything about it if she didn't remember me.

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:07.070
Mom entrusted Hina-chan to me, yet...

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:11.740
That's why I wanted her to be happy. That's why!

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:15.250
That's why you put her ahead of yourself?

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:20.290
I understand your feelings.

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:21.880
But...

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:27.010
But... I'm sure that's not what Haruna wants.

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:39.060
I'm sorry to have you accompany me on a weekend.

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:41.900
Thanks to your help, I was able to do some good shopping.

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:43.190
Thank you.

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:45.320
You're welcome.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:48.490
I had something I wanted to talk about with you, too.

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:52.490
I see.

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:55.240
Onee-chan said things like that...

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:59.120
Can you forgive her?

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:03.250
She was doing it because she cared about you.

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:07.090
I know! It's hard on me because I know!

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:11.010
It's not about forgiving her or not forgiving her.

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:13.510
Haruna...

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:22.480
You know I lost a year's worth of memories because of the accident, right?

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:26.980
Yeah. I was surprised when I heard the news from Kanade-san.

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:35.620
It's from that time on that Onee-chan started to care so much for me and prioritized me ahead of herself.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:39.120
But I don't like that.

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:42.420
My body has been weak since I was little...

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:45.290
Causing so much trouble for her...

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:50.970
If it wasn't for that accident, she wouldn't be so...

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:52.970
"Be so"?

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:58.140
I think it's Onee-chan who likes Kouhei-kun.

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:00.100
Kanade-san does?

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:04.100
That's why I'm more confused.

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:09.820
She may be placing the blame for the accident on herself again and hiding her true feelings.

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:11.740
If I think of that possibility...

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:15.240
I don't want to cause any more trouble for her.

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:18.290
I want her to catch up with her own happiness.

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:22.080
If she won't...

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:24.580
...then I can't.

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:26.380
I'm not allowed to!

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:28.670
Haruna.

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:33.800
Let's go, Haruna.

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:36.300
Go where?

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:39.760
We need to go tell Kanade-san those feelings.

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:42.680
Honestly, without holding back anything.

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:43.690
But...

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:46.810
At this rate, nothing will be solved.

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:49.190
Right?

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:51.610
Kouhei-kun...

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:07.080
Hina-chan.

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:08.670
Onee-chan.

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:10.670
Um, I-

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:12.050
You're not fair, Onee-chan.

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:18.050
That's how I always felt as a child.

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:26.480
I couldn't go to school most of the time, but you were always on your feet, doing what you liked.

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:29.230
I was always jealous of you.

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:34.820
No, to be totally honest, I hated you for that.

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:37.070
Hina-chan...

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:44.540
That's why, when I got better and was able to play with everyone, every day was so fun.

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:49.670
It happened because I went out without listening to you.

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:58.390
I'm sure it was punishment for hating you rather than thanking you when you were looking after me.

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:01.810
That accident wasn't your fault.

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:05.810
So I don't want you to place me ahead of yourself.

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:06.600
Okay?

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:08.850
Hina-chan,

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:09.900
You idiot!

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:11.110
What are you saying?!

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:16.030
I never took good care of you when you were in the hospital!

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:18.910
I hardly went to see you.

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:23.620
It was me who always thought of you as annoying!

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:26.000
Onee-chan...

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:32.630
Because Mom used to be completely occupied with taking care of you, and I was always alone.

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:33.880
I was lonely...

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:38.010
I couldn't forgive Hina-chan for taking all of our parent's love.

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:41.470
I was such a bad girl.

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:44.350
You were having the hardest time, yet...

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:47.480
Then Mom entrusted you to me...

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:51.520
And when you finally got well, you got in that accident.

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:57.740
That's when I swore...

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:04.120
I have to repent for all the bad things I've done to you...

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:07.500
I have to make you happy...

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:10.370
And I would do anything for that.

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:11.880
Onee-chan...

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:15.590
I want you to be happy.

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:17.880
I have to make you happy.

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:21.340
But I don't want you sacrificing yourself for that!

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:23.470
I want you to be happy!

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:29.140
Until you are, I can't be!

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:32.980
Hina-chan...

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:35.360
Onee-chan...

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:42.820
This is strange, don't you think?

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:47.830
Yeah.

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:49.870
Let's make up.

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:52.120
Yeah.

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:54.080
A true make up.

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:57.840
Hina-chan!

00:19:57.840 --> 00:20:00.420
I'm never letting go of you again!

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:00.420
Onee-chan, you're hurting me.

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:03.840
You're my precious little sister.

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:05.850
Okay, I know.

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:06.890
Kanade-san.

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:08.100
Hasekura Kouhei-sama

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:10.140
Could you read this?

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:11.390
What's that?

00:20:12.810 --> 00:20:14.020
That's...

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:17.690
"How are you, Kouhei-kun?"

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:20.740
"I'm told I used to call you 'Kou-chan' before."

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:23.030
"I heard from Onee-chan."

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:27.240
It's a letter Haruna sent me shortly after losing her memories.

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:32.080
She sent me the letter, asking to exchange letters again with someone she didn't remember.

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:34.120
Really?

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:39.960
Back then, I was frantic to get back the time I had lost.

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:42.840
But I don't think that was all there was to it.

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:46.390
Memories are important,

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:52.980
but I think Haruna was trying to take a step forward, accepting the past as past.

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:56.060
There's no point in being held back by the past.

00:20:56.230 --> 00:21:02.990
She must have been trying to make new memories just like she is now. With an honest and truthful heart.

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:05.860
Just like I am now...

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:08.490
An honest and truthful heart...

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:14.000
But then, I probably would never have picked up on it if I hadn't come to this school.

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:17.000
Do you think we can?

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:20.630
Our new memories...

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:22.420
I'm sure we can.

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:29.470
I'm back, and we're all here together with honest hearts.

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:34.930
Kouhei, do you remember the old promise we made?

00:21:34.930 --> 00:21:36.140
Promise?

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:37.520
Yeah.

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:39.980
Thank you, Hosaka Zelkova.

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:42.360
You made my wish...

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:46.450
...our wish... come true.

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:48.740
Please.

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:51.660
Hear my wish...

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:53.620
I wish Kouhei would...

00:21:53.620 --> 00:21:55.000
...Kou-chan would...

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:58.500
...come back to this island...

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:01.250
...so the three of us can play together again.

00:22:06.170 --> 00:22:11.720
We wish we can continue to make many fun memories on this island.

00:22:15.220 --> 00:22:22.560
I miss you

00:22:15.220 --> 00:22:22.560
I miss you.

00:22:33.080 --> 00:22:42.710
Mabushii kurai e ni kaita jikan nano

00:22:33.080 --> 00:22:42.710
Just like in a perfect painting,

00:22:42.710 --> 00:22:47.470
Sou ima ha...

00:22:42.710 --> 00:22:47.470
Now is a dazzling moment.

00:22:51.760 --> 00:23:01.520
Kawari hajimeta machinami ni me wo sorashi

00:22:51.760 --> 00:23:01.520
I look away from the city that's starting to change

00:23:01.520 --> 00:23:07.240
Omoide ha tada iuno

00:23:01.520 --> 00:23:07.240
And my memories whisper to me, saying,

00:23:07.240 --> 00:23:14.370
Soko de tomadou dake

00:23:07.240 --> 00:23:14.370
You're only at a loss.

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:16.370
I miss you

00:23:16.370 --> 00:23:20.620
Omoi wo sono mama dakishimete

00:23:16.370 --> 00:23:20.620
Hold on to your feelings.

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:22.540
I miss you

00:23:22.540 --> 00:23:26.880
Kawaranu omoi wo shiritai no

00:23:22.540 --> 00:23:26.880
I want to know how you've always felt.

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:28.760
I miss you

00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:32.510
Negatteru kara

00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:32.510
I'll always long for you, so...

00:23:33.050 --> 00:23:38.520
I miss you...

00:23:46.920 --> 00:23:49.630
Excuse me! What do I need to do to become part of the Cleaning Committee?

00:23:49.710 --> 00:23:52.000
I want to wear that cute maid outfit!

00:23:52.000 --> 00:23:53.200
Please don't push!

00:23:53.210 --> 00:23:55.570
Please form one line!

00:23:56.720 --> 00:23:59.010
It's the great response that was expected.

00:24:00.390 --> 00:24:03.180
Good job, me!

00:24:05.000 --> 00:24:20.100
「Omen」

00:24:05.080 --> 00:24:20.100
Seventh Episode

00:24:06.730 --> 00:24:08.730
May I get a little excited?

00:24:08.730 --> 00:24:14.690
Look at how blue the sky is and how clear the air is.

00:24:15.150 --> 00:24:19.660
Everyone's smile is just like the red sun.
